u're driving through crowded downtown roads, quiet neighborhoods, or busy intersections, every route offers a new challenge. Smooth controls, realistic vehicle physics, and detailed environments create an authentic bus driving experience for both casual players and simulator enthusiasts.\n\nFeatures\n\ud83d\ude8c Realistic city bus driving in VR\n\ud83c\udf06 Explore a detailed modern city\n\ud83d\udc65 Pick up and drop off passengers\n\ud83d\udea6 Follow realistic traffic rules and signals\n\ud83c\udfae Intuitive VR controls for immersive gameplay\n\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Multiple routes and driving challenges\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Dynamic city environments\n\ud83d\ude8d Drive different types of city buses\n\ud83c\udfc6 Complete missions and improve your driving skills\n\ud83c\udfaf Designed for both beginners and simulator fans\n\nClimb into the driver's seat, keep your passengers happy, and become the ultimate city bus driver in Bus Simulator: Modern City Driving.", "short_description": "Drive realistic city buses, pick up passengers, follow traffic rules, and explore a modern city in an immersive VR bus driving simulator."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/diamondgamesstudio/privacy-policy-meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DiamondGamesStudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/diamondgamesstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_m